Layout: Three tabs matching the prototype:
  Shopping Lists | Purchase Orders | Suppliers

SHOPPING LISTS TAB

Left panel — Ingredients List (from inventory):
  Shows all inventory items with their stock status
  Color coded alerts: LOW (yellow/orange), EXPIRED (red)
  Columns: Ingredient, Category, Qty in Stock, Unit, + Add button
  "Add All Flagged" button: adds all low/expired items to the
    active shopping list with suggested restock quantities
  Suggested quantity = minimum_stock_threshold - quantity_in_stock
    plus any additional needed for next week's menu cycle

Right panel — Shopping List builder:
  List name (e.g. "Weekly Groceries — [date]")
  Save button (saves as draft)
  Create PO button (creates a purchase_order from this list)
  Search to add ingredients manually
