  Total Estimated at bottom (sum of all line items)
  
  Shopping list types:
    Manual: RND adds items manually
    Suggested: auto-generated from menu cycle requirements vs
      current stock levels + minimum stock threshold

  Suggested shopping list logic:
    1. Get active menu_cycle for the upcoming week
    2. Calculate total ingredient quantities needed for all meals
    3. Compare with current inventory.quantity_in_stock
    4. For each ingredient where stock < needed + minimum_stock_threshold:
       suggest purchase quantity = (needed + minimum_stock_threshold) - current_stock
    5. Only list items with a shortfall — do not include items with sufficient stock

